{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:01 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:01 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:01 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"旺角中心外男子遇襲受傷。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/3185a0ccb10fb8d2014577dc28533add/2026-10/page_175.jpg\"/><p>今日（22日）中午12時34分，旺角一名男子報案，指他在亞皆老街65號旺角中心對開，被3名男子揮拳襲擊受傷。警員到場發現兇徒已經逃去，經調查後相信事件涉及金錢糾紛，將案件列作「襲擊致造成身體傷害」，正追緝3名涉案男子。遇襲男子由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。</p><img alt=\"男子在旺角中心對開遇襲受傷。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8710138b51a9024a56e825fa5d6219f4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_14_09_49.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a5f62fab703ee6d9675c0c874a679ab1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_14_09_48.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"旺角發生襲擊案，疑事件涉及金錢糾紛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9514fa4200d5b911fd8b23f0e142fd2f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_14_09_47_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/62afbf6c464d07a339229f91d104d05b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_14_09_47.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/451e0002da4cf9f8510733485333f79a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_14_09_46.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:22:12.451021+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:39.128773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:39.128773+00:00","content_hash":"440f3ede993b401aaa945940b5314cf49baa620da536ed1f88d3704e0d4e77b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}